# AI provider settings belong to the application configuration center and are
# stored in Electron userData. Do not put provider credentials in workspace .env.
# Explicit operating-system or launch environment overrides are documented in
# docs/content-generation-operations.md.
# Do not add XQW_API_KEY, HEPAN_COOKIE_PATH, Cookie contents, or other provider
# secrets here. Configure paid media and Hepan in the application Settings;
# process environment overrides are read-only and are never persisted.
